    {
      "fact": "gx",
      "optional": true,
      "say": "Evaluate both at \\(([[p]], [[q]])\\): \\(f_{x} = [[gx]]\\) and \\(f_{y} = [[gy]]\\), so \\(\\nabla f([[p]], [[q]]) = ([[gx]], [[gy]])\\)."
    }
  ],
  "answer": "So the answer is \\([[answer]]\\)."
